users/DamienRabier","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DamienRabier/LOL_Esport_Visualisation/commits/748fe4f533554b52d95ede5a6f68f4cfb42666f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T12:27:52Z","email":"damien.rabier@etu.univ-tours.fr","name":"Damien Rabier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T12:27:52Z","email":"damien.rabier@etu.univ-tours.fr","name":"Damien Rabier"},"message":"Migrate to FastAPI + React web app; add OE early-game data & new sections\n\nReplace the Streamlit dashboard with a proper web app and expand the analysis.\n\nBackend (FastAPI, backend/main.py)\n- JSON API over the existing query layer: overview, games, teams, team,\n  players, player, draft, plus tournament catalog and ingestion.\n- Auto-refresh on launch (background): re-ingests tracked leagues\n  (LCK, LEC, LCS, LTA N/S, LCK CL, First Stand, MSI, EWC, Worlds), skipping\n  tournaments that have already ended and are loaded.\n- Oracle''s Elixir: bulk-loaded 2019-2026 (lane diffs at 10/15/20/25); daily\n  best-effort refresh of the current year + on-demand refresh endpoint.\n\nFrontend (frontend/, Vite + React + TS + Recharts)\n- Sections: Overview, Games, Teams (leaderboard) + Team scouting,\n  Players (leaderboard) + Player scouting, Draft, Add data.\n- Warm \"Cream Ink\" theme; win/loss & ban-rate bars; leaderboards with sortable\n  columns, colour-coded %/diffs, and click-through to detail pages.\n- Load-time refresh progress overlay + sidebar status.\n\nData/analysis\n- OE lane diffs surfaced across tables (game scoreboard, player game log,\n  team recent games) and champion/team/player aggregates.\n- Overview top-3 players by KDA, DPM, and GD@15 (click through to detail).\n\nKept the legacy Streamlit app.py during the migration.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cfad62e057500c0a2b13c549efd0fdba4abd3b82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DamienRabier/LOL_Esport_Visualisation/git/trees