type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DamienRabier/LOL_Esport_Visualisation/commits/5fec8a65cd1a074831420f4b468dbfdde66e6c1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T21:48:24Z","email":"damien.rabier@etu.univ-tours.fr","name":"Damien Rabier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T21:48:24Z","email":"damien.rabier@etu.univ-tours.fr","name":"Damien Rabier"},"message":"Add game-by-game view, win/loss & ban-rate bars, sidebar ingestion\n\nDashboard improvements:\n- New \"Games\" tab: pick a game to see the full player scoreboard, team\n  objectives, and bans (joined on GameId).\n- Champion charts now show a green/red win-loss split bar with percentage\n  labels instead of a winrate colour gradient (Overview, Team, Player).\n- Ban charts show a blue ban-rate bar with percentage labels; added\n  banrate_pct to top_bans/team_bans queries.\n- Ingestion moved to a dedicated \"Add data\" page reached via a sidebar\n  button; available even when the database is empty.\n- Catalog refresh can fetch only recent tournaments (fast, one request)\n  and handles Leaguepedia rate-limit errors gracefully.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2737d4b9e2daa96dc29d104befdef08abf2321e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DamienRabier/LOL_Esport_Visualisation/git/trees/2737d4b9e2daa96dc29d104befdef08abf2321e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DamienRabier/LOL_Esport_Visualisation/git/commits/5fec8a65cd1a074831420f4b468dbfdde66e6c1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113183652?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DamienRabier/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DamienRabier/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DamienRabier/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DamienRabier/gists{/gist_i