eb","id":68741518,"login":"Oluwafemi-web","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NzQxNTE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kainy2/umojalinn-FE/commits/1a1dad620e779d2e8ff75519b8e61312b0a1f2f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T22:21:18Z","email":"ogoayorindeshekinah@gmail.com","name":"Shekinah Ogo-Ayorinde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T22:21:18Z","email":"ogoayorindeshekinah@gmail.com","name":"Shekinah Ogo-Ayorinde"},"message":"Add funding-fees dialog and checkout flow\n\nIntroduce a fees-aware funding flow: add FundingFeesDialog, useFundingFeesCheckout hook, and getCollectionFeeFormula util. Persist payment fees in types (UmojaLinnPaymentFees) and show a fees breakdown before opening checkout; if no fees, open checkout directly. Wire the new flow into SelectFundingMethod, Milestone Timeline, and FundAlert. Other changes: exclude delivery milestones from platform commission in Invoice, coerce milestone amounts to Number in escrow page, add useGetInfiniteBuyerProjects and refactor infinite project list logic, small UI/text tweaks and a Disconnect Stripe button in PaymentSettingsForm.","tree":{"sha":"f71d783ea3f88b263e141bc851faee0729d81ed5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kainy2/umojalinn-FE/git/trees/f71d783ea3f88b263e141bc851faee0729d81ed5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kainy2/umojalinn-FE/git/commits/1a1dad620e779d2e8ff75519b8e61312b0a1f2f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":nul