inah@gmail.com","name":"Shekinah Ogo-Ayorinde"},"message":"Handle wallet-impact refunds and UI updates\n\nAdd logic to detect when a dispute/refund impacts a designer''s wallet and require top-up if balance is insufficient (new helpers: doesDisputeImpactDesignerWallet, doesSelectionImpactDesignerWallet, shouldRedirectToInsufficientBalance). Pass milestone transactionStatus through selection lists. Update RefundRequest to use the new check. Adjust dispute UI: refined DisputeListItem layout, show action banner when appropriate, tweak DisputeActivities/ResolvedContent styles and milestone status labeling, remove auto-expand behavior, and small copy change in milestone cancellation dialog. Improves correctness and UX around refunds and disputes.","tree":{"sha":"bfcc85675257f24d283bc9df3539b42caac87ed8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kainy2/umojalinn-FE/git/trees/bfcc85675257f24d283bc9df3539b42caac87ed8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kainy2/umojalinn-FE/git/commits/fb6c09aa713b4535d7e3ecc8e9332897782b999a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68741518?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Oluwafemi-web","id":68741518,"login":"Oluwafemi-web","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4NzQxNTE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://a