"subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kainy2/umojalinn-FE/commits/981aefd7d1362d11e02418ee12f3a87a7f14d1f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-13T07:05:46Z","email":"ogoayorindeshekinah@gmail.com","name":"Shekinah Ogo-Ayorinde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-13T07:05:46Z","email":"ogoayorindeshekinah@gmail.com","name":"Shekinah Ogo-Ayorinde"},"message":"Add tour-persistent actions for bid creation\n\nIntroduce awaitable tour events and handlers to persist bid data during the guided tour. Added two new tour events and dispatchers (save milestone, request measurements) with a timeout fallback in lib/tour. Tour card now awaits these dispatches when advancing steps. Milestone card and SelectModeView listen for the tour events and persist data (using refs to capture current state) so the tour can trigger saves/requests. Updated hooks/use-bid-edit to use async mutation APIs, update local milestone state after saves, and add excess-budget confirmation flow (openExcessDialog, handleExcessConfirm) which is exposed to the edit page. Sizing-template tour building now conditionally includes the measurement-request step based on template/project state. Also minor JSX/id/structure adjustments in Milestone card to support tour targeting.","tree":{"sha":"eab5798e39e1da28076e2a3313196e7cc73ee937","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kainy2/umojalinn-FE/git/trees/eab5798e39e1da28076e2a3313196e7cc73ee937"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kainy2/umojalinn-FE/git/commits/981aefd7d1362d11e02418ee12f3a87a7f14d1f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68741518?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/events{/privacy}","followers_ur