com/users/Oluwafemi-web/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kainy2/umojalinn-FE/commits/fde5622d603003da6a8cd5dcfddee3bf6361b7f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:39:38Z","email":"ogoayorindeshekinah@gmail.com","name":"Shekinah Ogo-Ayorinde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T13:39:38Z","email":"ogoayorindeshekinah@gmail.com","name":"Shekinah Ogo-Ayorinde"},"message":"Sizing templates: gender-conversion & pagination\n\nHandle opposite-gender sizing template conversions and add infinite pagination for designer projects. Introduces getClearedSizingTemplatePayload to clear measurements when converting template gender and updates flows so users must re-enter height/standard size via HeightAndSizeModal before attaching/accepting templates. Switches many project queries to an infinite API (useGetInfiniteDesignerProjects + useInfiniteData) and adds \"See more\" / load-more UI in dashboard and active project lists. Also includes related UX fixes: menu portal for Wallet select, revised Stripe modal button layout/labels, and tweaks to template edit/update validation and buyer edit permissions (canBuyerFullyEdit) so in-use/live rules behave correctly.","tree":{"sha":"898705163496393057985e99b09a03252b21fc4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kainy2/umojalinn-FE/git/trees/898705163496393057985e99b09a03252b21fc4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kainy2/umojalinn-FE/git/commits/fde5622d603003da6a8cd5dcfddee3bf6361b7f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at