/Oluwafemi-web","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kainy2/umojalinn-FE/commits/be43614262822d5ad458e4e48093cc8a06b11fe4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T03:19:50Z","email":"ogoayorindeshekinah@gmail.com","name":"Shekinah Ogo-Ayorinde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T03:19:50Z","email":"ogoayorindeshekinah@gmail.com","name":"Shekinah Ogo-Ayorinde"},"message":"Integrate NextStep guided tours across app\n\nAdd NextStep guided tour support and hooks across the dashboard. This introduces a NextStep tour provider, TourReadyMarker and multiple tour launcher/placeholder components and tour constants, plus helper libs (src/lib/tour, create-bid-tour). UI components and pages were annotated with tour target IDs and hooks (pages, cards, wallet, bids, milestones, sizing templates, appbar, sidebar, etc.) to enable step targets. next.config and package.json updated to transpile and include nextstepjs (and motion). Minor CSS added to handle NextStep card sizing. Overall this enables in-app guided tours and onboarding targets throughout the dashboard.","tree":{"sha":"0a4073f49b0c8edd1fa8b2c5f4442b7ec215be04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kainy2/umojalinn-FE/git/trees/0a4073f49b0c8edd1fa8b2c5f4442b7ec215be04"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Kainy2/umojalinn-FE/git/commits/be43614262822d5ad458e4e48093cc8a06b11fe4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68741518?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Oluwafemi-web/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Oluwafemi-web","id":68741518,"login":"Oluwafemi-web","node_id"