nielsmanioto/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielsmanioto","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/danielsmanioto/design-patterns-arquiteturais/commits/cbeba2dffe968a601fc909204b273750d72ce7a4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T02:09:25Z","email":"daniel.smanioto@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Augusto Smanioto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T02:09:25Z","email":"daniel.smanioto@gmail.com","name":"Daniel Augusto Smanioto"},"message":"docs: apply standardized pattern template to pattern READMEs\n\nAdd comprehensive pattern documentation template and apply to key patterns:\n\nPATTERN_TEMPLATE.md:\n- Template covering all sections: O que é, Quando usar, Vantagens/Desvantagens\n- Arquitetura, Diagramas C4/Mermaid, Exemplos Java/Node/AWS\n- Testes, Trade-offs, Referências\n- Padrões relacionados e FAQ\n\nUpdated Aggregator Pattern:\n- Complete architecture with parallel service calls visualization\n- Mermaid sequence and component diagrams\n- Full Node.js implementation example with Promise.all\n- Java Spring Boot implementation with WebClient\n- AWS deployment with Terraform/CloudFormation\n- Trade-offs analysis with performance comparison\n- Docker Compose testing instructions\n\nUpdated Circuit Breaker Pattern:\n- State machine (CLOSED/OPEN/HALF_OPEN) with transitions\n- Complete Spring Boot + Resilience4j implementation\n- Mermaid state and decision flow diagrams\n- Programmatic and annotation-based usage\n- Unit tests with MockMvc\n- Node.js example with Opossum library\n- AWS Lambda integration\n- Threshold and configuration guidance\n- Fallback strategies and resilience testing\n\nBoth patterns include:\n- Comprehensive diagrams with Mermaid\n- Multiple implementation examples\n- Real testing scenarios\n- Performance and resilience trade-offs\n- Related patterns and references\n- FAQ sections\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8111