github.com/users/MarceloGarcia92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarceloGarcia92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarceloGarcia92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarceloGarcia92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarceloGarcia92","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarceloGarcia92/meal-planner/commits/16784a36fcdffdb47e154409e838ffe5ca94b3cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T02:49:45Z","email":"marcelo.garcia.c92@gmail.com","name":"mgarciaITMeet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T02:49:45Z","email":"marcelo.garcia.c92@gmail.com","name":"mgarciaITMeet"},"message":"feat: implement GraphQL API for meal planning application\n\n- Add authentication handling in `auth.py` with support for development and Clerk JWT modes.\n- Create executable GraphQL schema in `schema.py`, defining queries and mutations for user and meal management.\n- Implement PostgreSQL repository pattern in `repositories.py` for food items, meal plans, and users.\n- Define SQL schema for the application in `schema_sql.py`, including tables for users, recipes, food items, meal plans, shopping lists, and user preferences.\n- Establish RLS transaction management in `session.py` to enforce user isolation.\n- Create application commands and use cases for adding food items and meal plans in `commands.py` and `use_cases.py`.\n- Define domain models for food items, meal plans, recipes, and users in respective files.\n- Set up configuration management in `config.py` for environment-driven settings.\n- Add error handling for domain-specific errors in `errors.py`.\n- Implement entry point for Uvicorn server in `asgi.py`.","tree":{"sha":"3a3732b0deb9aba8b01626b9cec31542d6aec3b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MarceloGarcia92/meal-planner/git/trees/3a3732b0deb9aba8b01626b9cec31542d6aec3b3"},"url":"https://api.g